<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 80 mln punts of 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 80 mln punts of 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Thursday that it would auction 80 million Irish pounds of the 8.0 percent bond due 2006 on Tuesday, June 17.</p>
<p>Bidding at the auction, to be held at 1000 local time (0900 GMT), will be confined to primary dealers.</p>
<p>Up to 16 million punts of stock will be offered in a non-competitive auction, the NTMA said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
